    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 582,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Meta Department\nMeta ( [ \u02c8meta ] ) is a department of Colombia . It is close to the geographic center of the country , to the east of the Andean mountains . A large portion of the department , which is also crossed by the Meta River , is covered by a grassland plain known as the Llanos . Its capital is Villavicencio . The department has a monument placed in the very geographic centre of Colombia , at a place known as Alto de Menegua , a few kilometers from Puerto L\u00f3pez . Achagua , which is similar to Piapoco , is an Indigenous language spoken by a minority in the department ."
     }
    ],
    "status": "ok"
   },
